 "final_summary": "The bug was that the task state machine allowed transitioning from 'blocked' to 'done'. The fix modified the TRANSITIONS dictionary in models.py to only allow 'blocked' to 'in_progress', thereby properly rejecting 'blocked' to 'done' transitions with a 409 status code.",
